      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Purposely <span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">innovative.​</span></span></span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Powerfully <span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">integrated.</span></span></span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\">​</span><br>\n​<br>\n<span class=\"futura-bold\">Mako means more for the future of the shoulder.​</span><br>\n​<br>\nIntroducing Mako Shoulder, the powerful and innovative integration of​ Mako, Tornier and Blueprint.​</h2>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Feb 24 2026 22:18:56 GMT+0000",
