          "text": "<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Intraoperative features</span></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"standalone-link\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Haptically guided reverse shoulder glenoid implant preparation for primary joint replacement, including the glenoid surface, boss and post/screw ​​</span></span></span></p>\n",
