          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Designed for control in reverse shoulder arthroplasty cases</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Tornier Perform Reversed Glenoid was developed to address cuff tear arthropathy and osteoarthritis and was designed to address all glenoid bone loss classifications from Walch and Sirveaux.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
